{
    "title": "SoFi - Banking & Investing",
    "description": "Get up to $1000 in stock when you open and fund an active invest account. Bank, borrow, budget, and invest- all in one app. \r\n\r\nWHY DO OVER 8.8 MILLION MEMBERS LOVE SOFI?\r\n\r\nHIGH-YIELD MOBILE BANKING\r\n\u2022 Earn up to 4.30% APY with our <b>mobile banking app</b>- 9x the national average savings rate.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy no account fees on mobile banking with no minimum balance requirements on your accounts.\r\n\u2022 Access your money at over 55,000 ATMs nationwide for convenient mobile banking.\r\n\u2022 Advance your paycheck by up to 2 days when you set up direct deposit with our online bank. *\r\n\u2022 Secure your funds with FDIC insurance up to $250,000 on your mobile bank account.\r\n\r\nSMART INVESTING\r\n\u2022 Invest in stocks and ETFs without commission through our mobile <b>investing</b> app.\r\n\u2022 Access exclusive IPO investments at IPO prices directly from your investing app.\r\n\u2022 Start investing with as little as $5 using fractional shares in our easy-to-use investing app.\r\n\u2022 Get up to $1,000 in stock when you open and fund an active invest account.\r\n\r\nPOWERFUL BUDGET TRACKER\r\n\u2022 Connect all your accounts to our <b>budget tracker</b> for a comprehensive financial overview.\r\n\u2022 Set and monitor custom savings goals with our advanced budgeting tools.\r\n\u2022 Gain insights by categorizing and analyzing your spending in our budget tracker app.\r\n\u2022 Stay on top of your finances with bill payment reminders from our money management app.\r\n\u2022 Track your credit score for and receive updates to help advance your financial health.\r\n\r\nSupport: Call (855) 456-SOFI (7634) or chat with us online at https://www.sofi.com/contact-us/\r\n\r\n*Early access to direct deposit funds is based on the timing in which we receive notice of impending payment from the Federal Reserve, which is typically up to two days before the scheduled payment date, but may vary.\r\n\r\n<b>Bank</b>, <b>borrow</b>, <b>budget</b>, and <b>invest</b>- all in one <b>finance</b> app. Download SoFi for Android devices on Google Play.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get up to $1000 in stock when you open and fund an active invest account. Bank, borrow, budget, and invest- all in one app. <br><br>WHY DO OVER 8.8 MILLION MEMBERS LOVE SOFI?<br><br>HIGH-YIELD MOBILE BANKING<br>\u2022 Earn up to 4.30% APY with our <b>mobile banking app</b>- 9x the national average savings rate.<br>\u2022 Enjoy no account fees on mobile banking with no minimum balance requirements on your accounts.<br>\u2022 Access your money at over 55,000 ATMs nationwide for convenient mobile banking.<br>\u2022 Advance your paycheck by up to 2 days when you set up direct deposit with our online bank. *<br>\u2022 Secure your funds with FDIC insurance up to $250,000 on your mobile bank account.<br><br>SMART INVESTING<br>\u2022 Invest in stocks and ETFs without commission through our mobile <b>investing</b> app.<br>\u2022 Access exclusive IPO investments at IPO prices directly from your investing app.<br>\u2022 Start investing with as little as $5 using fractional shares in our easy-to-use investing app.<br>\u2022 Get up to $1,000 in stock when you open and fund an active invest account.<br><br>POWERFUL BUDGET TRACKER<br>\u2022 Connect all your accounts to our <b>budget tracker</b> for a comprehensive financial overview.<br>\u2022 Set and monitor custom savings goals with our advanced budgeting tools.<br>\u2022 Gain insights by categorizing and analyzing your spending in our budget tracker app.<br>\u2022 Stay on top of your finances with bill payment reminders from our money management app.<br>\u2022 Track your credit score for and receive updates to help advance your financial health.<br><br>Support: Call (855) 456-SOFI (7634) or chat with us online at https://www.sofi.com/contact-us/<br><br>*Early access to direct deposit funds is based on the timing in which we receive notice of impending payment from the Federal Reserve, which is typically up to two days before the scheduled payment date, but may vary.<br><br><b>Bank</b>, <b>borrow</b>, <b>budget</b>, and <b>invest</b>- all in one <b>finance</b> app. Download SoFi for Android devices on Google Play.",
